    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d352-a1-a1">

                <pb facs="0648" n="554" sameAs="frus:frus1887/pg554"/>

                <p>I, Augustus Rogers, one of the crew of schooner <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Gleaner</hi>, being duly sworn, do depose and say, that I went with Capt.
                    Medeo Rose to the custom-house at Shelburne, Nova Scotia, on the 19th day of
                    April last, and also on the 3d day of June. I heard his conversation with
                    Collector Atwood on both occasions, and hereby certify that the statements of
                    those interviews, as made above, are correct and true.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Augustus Rogers.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
